Z||000043||Old Lar||01-15-2001||09:03 PM||||Friday registration, clean the car, shoot the breeze, clean the car, jump in the pool shoot the breeze some more, jump in the ocean visit night spots in Daytona Beach.  Saturday rise early wipe off salt mist from the car, head over to the track for photo and placement on show field, final cleaning of car, wander around to check out the 2000 or so other cars there.  Judging 11:00, they had teams of judges last year.  You get to select best of show. Road ralley maybe, or stay at the track check out vendors etc, head back to the hotel, jump in the pool, catch some shuteye after roasting in the sun.<BR>Banquet:  drinks at 6, dinner at 7, awards 8:30, door prizes interspersed with awards.<P>Sunday go back to the track, if you want to see more cars.  They try to get a beach photo of Fieros if the tide cooperates early Sunday.<P>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 01-15-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Old Lar (edited 01-15-2001).]||||reg||3
